# Build context for the API image.
#
# ★ BuildKit reads this in preference to the root `.dockerignore` because it is
# named after the Dockerfile. It exists so the API's context can exclude
# `apps/web` — a few hundred megabytes the API never reads — now that the web
# app builds from the same repository root.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Its own dependency tree, deliberately outside the workspace.
docs/spikes

# The API image does not contain the web app.
apps/web

docs
*.md
!apps/api/assets/fonts/README.md

**/coverage
**/.vitest
